    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What happened...?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I come to my senses and find myself in an unfamiliar space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first glance, it looks like an ordinary restroom, but something feels off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no doors to enter or exit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How did I end up here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And how can I escape this place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for hidden clues and investigate this mysterious space to uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a moment that calls for your wisdom and intuition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape this isolated space?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the challenge. It won\u2019t be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you the one who can solve this mystery?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[The Paradixion: Restroom] is a point-and-click adventure game with a mysterious atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve various puzzles and discover hidden elements within the game to collect clues about the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With easy controls and no special requirements, anyone can play the game without difficulty.</p>",
